## Disable Waystone drop
I would like to have this configuration so that I can disable that Winstone could be collected from villages and place them somewhere else. 

```
@Synced
@Comment("List of waystone origins that prevent waystones from beeing dropped when there are broken.")
@NestedType(WaystoneOrigin.class)
public Set<WaystoneOrigin> restrictWaystoneDrop = Set.of();
```

## Disable Waystone breaking
I would like to have this configuration so that waystone could not be destroyed if there are already activated by players. I think this could requiere a way to disable waystone for you self so that if all players on a server desided together they want to remove the waystone they could all deactivate it and than it would be breakable.

```
@Synced
@Comment("Waystones could not be destroyed as long if at least one player has activated the waystone.")
public boolean restrictActivatedBreaking = false;
```

In addition to that it would be nice to have also the possibility to prevent breaking dependent on `WaystoneOrigin` 

```
@Synced
@Comment("List of waystone origins that prevent waystones from beeing destroyed.")
@NestedType(WaystoneOrigin.class)
public Set<WaystoneOrigin> restrictWaystoneBreaking = Set.of();
```

